  "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "5d9d0487-f75a-4313-9ff2-a3ffcff914dd"],
 " the values of several."
}], "Usage",ExpressionUUID->"1e7761f7-e6b6-43b6-8a2b-0b5873992a91"],

Cell[TextData[{
 Cell[BoxData[
  TemplateBox[{
    Cell[
     TextData["FindInfraScene"]], 
    "paclet:WolframInstitute/InfraGeometry/ref/FindInfraScene", 
    "WolframInstitute/InfraGeometry Package Symbol"},
   "PackageLink",
   BaseStyle->"InlineFormula"]], "InlineFormula",ExpressionUUID->
  "2b0c61ff-4961-4e97-bfee-10a9c39fd02f"],
 " returns a ",
 Cell[BoxData["List"], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "4fe9dfe3-5ff8-4228-8898-7709e8a281c0"],
 " of instances, one per branch. An instance is inert: it holds its bindings \
and computes nothing."
}], "Notes",ExpressionUUID->"4a181b84-5cbe-4ead-9f5d-b923b108ec0c"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "A value is what the construction of the object realised on the graph: a \
vertex for a point or an intersection, a vertex list for a segment, a ray or \
a line, a cyclic vertex list for a circle. So an instance's objects are drawn \
by ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  TemplateBox[{
    Cell[
     TextData["InfraSubstrateHighlight"]], 
    "paclet:WolframInstitute/InfraGeometry/ref/InfraSubstrateHighlight", 
    "WolframInstitute/InfraGeometry Package Symbol"},
   "PackageLink",
   BaseStyle->"InlineFormula"]], "InlineFormula",ExpressionUUID->
  "b862f03c-a3ca-466d-a09a-3f97ec7daf29"],
 " directly, a circle once it is closed into a walk."
}], "Notes",ExpressionUUID->"dfc8b178-11f2-403c-bd06-63a1118f191c"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "An object the instance does not bind reads as ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{"Missing", "[", 
   RowBox[{"\"\<KeyAbsent\>\"", ",", " ", "x"}], "]"}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "cef190e5-f5dc-4ec0-a9ca-39fc4816a3b1"],
 ". The second argument also reads a bare ",
 Cell[BoxData["Association"], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "c2109db6-26cb-4b3a-beaa-36bf3c6c5308"],
 " of bindings."
}], "Notes",ExpressionUUID->"9d2397b6-993d-4f33-a1e2-cf0beacebbff"]
}, Open  ]],

